#. ~ Description of "prosthetic right arm"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
msgid ""
"A prosthetic arm, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  Its "
"modern design and sleek ergonomics make it very comfortable and highly "
"suitable for use, and advanced designing makes it look exactly like the "
"original.  With grips attached to the hands and inbuilt springs, this "
"prosthetic also allows some use of function.  This one is for the right arm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "prosthetic left arm"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
