#. ~ Description of "right peg leg"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/legs_prosthetics.json
msgid ""
"A prosthetic leg, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  A "
"primitive peg leg, often remembered for pirate movies and such, this was a "
"go-to replacement for decades for those who couldn't afford an iron or steel "
"one.  This comes up above the knee and is fastened on with straps or rope, "
"with the interior cushioned by stuffing.  This one is for the right leg."
msgstr ""

